{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Club Soko, you must read the room by\u00a0outsmarting the visitors of each dancefloor using what you have around you. Each level is carefully crafted to teach you new, surprising and tricky ways of delving deeper and deeper into the depths of an exclusive nightclub. Secrets lurk in the depths of Club Soko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507130/extras/club_soko_steam_002.gif?t=1745182725\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as Maude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Maude, a graffiti artist set on spray painting her tag on every available inch of the nightclub walls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507130/extras/club_soko_steam_005.gif?t=1745182725\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note that this is a <strong>demo</strong> that features a small slice of the final game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience cool vibes of a exclusive nightclub by moving through the\u00a0<strong>first dancefloor</strong> and a get a small tease of future rooms to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate your way through over <strong>20\u00a0handcrafted levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push people around and tag up the place!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An artstyle inspired by flash games from early 2000s packed full of underground charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to the absolute bangers that Club Soko\u00a0and its subcultures have to offer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507130?t=1745182725","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.