all tease of future rooms to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate your way through over <strong>20\u00a0handcrafted levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push people around and tag up the place!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An artstyle inspired by flash games from early 2000s packed full of underground charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to the absolute bangers that Club Soko\u00a0and its subcultures have to offer.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Miracle Tea"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3346410","name":"Club Soko"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507130/header.jpg?t=1745182725","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257094208,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094208/movie480.mp4?t=1745182723","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094208/movie_max.mp4?t=1745182723"},"name":"Club Soko - Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094208/b41cc919a4b8798243cc0aaf6d218e14ae8211fe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745182723","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094208/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745182723","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094208/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745182723"}}],"name":"Club Soko Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true}